> MY MINE GUWEH

This folder will generate a large junk of log file by default. You can disable it by commenting/deleting the argument `log2file` in the `platformio.ini` file
Additionally, devlog will be dumped here, although it is primarily just a summary generated by AI every milestone session as the dev(s) see fit

